  "body": "This is your opportunity to purchase at Amaia within Takapuna, a prestigious new development on Esmonde Road between Takapuna & Hauraki. Fully complete with title & CCC issued, these premium apartments are move-in ready and offer a rare chance to secure a modern coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed by Jasmax, Amaia blends city vibrancy with coastal serenity. Inspired by forest canopies, this urban village offers light, space, comfort & community. Perfect for professionals, downsizers & investors seeking low-maintenance living in an unbeatable location.\r\n\r\nInside, every apartment features open-plan layouts, premium finishes, Miele appliances & private outdoor spaces. Enjoy sunrise walks on Takapuna Beach, strolls to local cafés, or quick access to the CBD.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n* 1 to 3 bedrooms with 1 to 2 bathrooms\r\n* Various layouts, sizes & levels\r\n* High end kitchens & bathrooms\r\n* Private balconies or winter gardens\r\n* Freehold strata titles\r\n* Concrete construction\r\n* Secure basement parking\r\n* Central landscaped plaza outlook\r\n\r\nLocation highlights:\r\n* Walkable, cycle-friendly, near coastal walkways\r\n* Minutes to Takapuna Beach, Auckland CBD & SH1\r\n* Future Northern Pathway access\r\n* Close to Hauraki, Belmont, Devonport & Milford\r\n\r\nTop education:\r\n* In zone for Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar & Westlake Girls High School\r\n\r\nMove-in ready, no waiting, no hassle. Contact Lily Han on 021 900 198 for viewing times or more information.\r\n\r\n* Photos are indicative only",
